  "_about": "River profiles: local knowledge the app adds to live conditions. A gauge matches a profile when its name contains one of 'match' (and not 'exclude') and it's in 'state', or its USGS id is in 'sites'. species: trout / steelhead / salmon. runs: months (1-12) fish are in the river, 'peak' = best months. hatches: extra local hatches, same format as hatches.json. dnr: words to look for in the Michigan DNR weekly report. feeds: RSS/Atom feeds of local shop reports (fetched daily by the GitHub Action). reports: links to other report pages. Facts are general and seasonal: always check current regulations. See README 'Adding a river profile'.",
